{"text": "LAST WILL AND TESTAMENT OF CORNELIUS AUGUSTIN\nVANDIVER\nI, Cornelius Augustin Vandiver, also known as C.A. Vandiver, a resident of\nBeaufort County, South Carolina, being ninety-one (91) years of age and of sound\nmind, declare this to be my Last Will and revoke all earlier wills and codicils.\n\nARTICLE I — Family\nMy wife, Henrietta Vandiver, died on February 2, 2019. I have two children,\nLucinda Vandiver Peebles and Augustin Vandiver Jr., and two grandchildren,\nWren Peebles and Amos Peebles.\n\nARTICLE II — Specific gifts\n To Mt. Carmel A.M.E. Church, where I have served as a deacon for forty years,\nthe sum of Ten Thousand Dollars ($10,000.00).\n To Odessa Gathers, who has kept my house and cared for me since my wife's\ndeath, the sum of $25,000 and my 2017 Buick, if she survives me.\n To my son Gus, my late wife's interest in the shrimp boat \"Miss Henrietta\" and\nall of my tools.\n\nARTICLE III — Residue\nI give the rest of my estate in equal shares to my two children. The share of any\ngrandchild under the age of twenty-five shall be held by my Executor as custodian\nunder the South Carolina Uniform Transfers to Minors Act.\n\nARTICLE IV — Executor\nI name my daughter Lucinda as Executor. If she cannot serve, I name Tidelands\nTrust Company. No bond shall be required.\n\nSigned on the 17th day of October, 2025, at Bluffton, South Carolina. Because my\neyesight has failed, this Will was read aloud to me before I signed it.\n\nCornelius A. Vandiver, Testator\n\nWitnesses, under S.C. Code Ann. § 62-2-502: Marcus Tindall, of Hardeeville;\nPhilippa Ravenel-Sims, of Bluffton.\n\nCLIENT DATA SHEET — not part of the Will\nRavenel-Sims Law Firm, LLC · File 25-EP-0417 · Prepared by P. Ravenel-Sims\n\n Client: Vandiver, Cornelius A. · born 06/11/1934 · SSN 084-35-7507 · widowed\n Home: 118 Egret Landing Road, Bluffton, SC 29910 · landline 843-555-0121 (no\nemail; hard of hearing, call after 10)\n Daughter: Lucinda Vandiver Peebles, 77 Gadsden Street, Charleston, SC 29401 ·\n843.555.0188 · lucinda.peebles@lowtidemail.example\n Son: Augustin Jr. (\"Gus\"), lives on the boat at the Port Royal landing. In\nrecovery; two DUI convictions (2011, 2016). Client does not want this\nmentioned in the Will.\n Grandchildren: Wren, born 2014; Amos, age 9. Wren has cystic fibrosis; discuss\na supplemental needs trust with Mrs. Peebles.\n Diagnoses the client reports: macular degeneration, atrial fibrillation, on\nwarfarin. Dr.'s capacity letter requested 10/09/25.\n\nSchedule A — assets (client's own figures)\n Home, Egret Landing Road, tax map no. R610 039 000 0218 0000: about\n$640,000.\n Port Royal Sound Bank checking 0077-41852 and CD 0077-90031: $38,200 and\n$150,000.\n Tidelands Trust Company agency account TT-204417: $412,775.18 at 9/30/2025.\n Burial policy no. BP-0091873, face amount $7,500.\n\nFee quoted: flat $1,800, paid by check no. 2291.", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 471 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Cornelius Augustin Vandiver", "Henrietta Vandiver", "Lucinda Vandiver Peebles", "Augustin Vandiver Jr.", "Wren Peebles", "Amos Peebles", "Gus", "Marcus Tindall", "Philippa Ravenel-Sims", "Cornelius A. Vandiver", "Augustin Jr."], "companies": ["Mt. Carmel A.M.E. Church", "Odessa Gathers", "Ravenel-Sims Law Firm, LLC", "Vandiver", "Egret Landing Road", "Port Royal Sound Bank", "Tidelands Trust Company", "lowtidemail.example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Beaufort County", "South Carolina", "Bluffton", "Hardeeville", "Charleston", "Port Royal"], "health": ["macular degeneration", "atrial fibrillation", "warfarin", "cystic fibrosis"], "sensitive": ["race or ethnicity", "religion", "widowed", "two DUI convictions"], "names": ["Cornelius Augustin Vandiver", "C.A. Vandiver", "Henrietta Vandiver", "Lucinda Vandiver Peebles", "Augustin Vandiver Jr.", "Wren Peebles", "Amos Peebles", "Gus", "Vandiver", "Cornelius", "Lucinda", "Augustin Jr.", "Wren", "Amos"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "